*.zip
frontend_hostinger_ready.zip
backend_complete.zip

# Docs / Plans
implementation_plan.md
walkthrough.md

# Test coverage output (regenerated by `npm run test:coverage`)
coverage/

# Generated test-coverage reports
#
# `generate-docx.js` produced the .docx files below from the PHPUnit/Jest
# output. The documents are build artifacts rather than source, and the Word
# lock files that sit beside them are recreated every time a document is opened
# in Word, so committing them produces churn on almost every open/save cycle.
~$*.docx
~$*.doc
/TEST_COVERAGE_REPORT*.docx
/generate-docx.js

# Root package.json / package-lock.json
#
# A throwaway manifest whose only dependency is `docx`, used solely by
# `generate-docx.js` above. It is not the application's manifest — that is
# `frontend/package.json` — and having a second one at the repo root confuses
# tooling about which project to install.
/package.json
/package-lock.json

